{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t荃灣工業中心對開晚上發生交通意外，一架小巴與兩架私家車相撞，至少7人受傷送院。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n警方表示，事發在晚上大約7時半，接獲一名小巴司機報案，指在荃灣路往荃灣方向，與兩架私家車相撞。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：李俊傑\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T13:41:16.109911+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T13:17:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T18:58:39.849134+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T13:38:38.896110+00:00","content_hash":"a5b57a6c0a52865dafeba8a392e7f9e1a9b46beaf78314cebe53bedf7c1cf9b7","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}